id: pm-gantt-chart-8mkl
title: Public history retains a personal mailbox and absolute host paths
description: "A 2026-08-17 full-history privacy scan found no high-confidence credential tokens and GitHub secret scanning reports zero alerts, but the repository is not privacy-clean under the fleet policy: the current tracked mailmap and historical identity material retain one non-noreply personal mailbox, and historical PM evidence retains obsolete absolute host checkout paths. Rewriting published history is destructive and coordination-sensitive, so this must block an unconditional privacy-ready claim and be handled as a dedicated maintainer-approved history-redaction migration."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
tags[3]: history-redaction,privacy,publication-blocker
