author: codex
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Maintainer approves canonical replacement identities and history rewrite scope; current mailmap contains only approved public/noreply identities; PM history literals are redacted with audited replacement records; all refs and release tags are rescanned; downstream clones and published artifacts are coordinated; GitHub secret and dependency alerts remain clear
risk: critical
severity: high
expected_result: "Current tracked files and every reachable/unreachable published object contain no personal mailbox, secret, private host location, or private service data beyond explicitly approved public identities."
actual_result: "Credential-shaped scan and GitHub secret scanning are clean, but identity and historical PM text still contain personal and host-local values."
